vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">免れる</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まぬがれる</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅱ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅱ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">免于；逃脱</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>責任<rp>(</rp><rt>せきにん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>免<rp>(</rp><rt>まぬが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れることはできない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他无法逃避责任。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">真似</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まね</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">模仿；仿效；学样；行为；举动；行为举止</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"220496\">この<ruby>鳥<rp>(</rp><rt>とり</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>人<rp>(</rp><rt>ひと</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>声<rp>(</rp><rt>こえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>真似<rp>(</rp><rt>まね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>できるんだ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这只鸟可以模仿人类的声音</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">招き</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">まねき</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n1\" href=\"../n1/vocab/\">N1</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">邀请；招待</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"227021\">お<ruby>招<rp>(</rp><rt>まね</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>き<ruby>下<rp>(</rp><rt>くだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>さってありがとうございました。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">很高兴你能邀请我们</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">招く</span><span class