rp>)</rp></ruby>した。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">大规模洪水使当地交通网络瘫痪。</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">マフラー</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">厚围巾；围脖；消声器；排气管消声器</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">まぶしい</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">い形容词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">い形容詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">耀眼；炫目</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"138189\"><ruby>太陽<rp>(</rp><rt>たいよう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がまぶしい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">我的眼睛被太阳蒙蔽了</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">まぶた</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">眼睑；眼皮</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"99739\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>眠<rp>(</rp><rt>ねむ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くて<ruby>瞼<rp>(</rp><rt>まぶた</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が<ruby>重<rp>(</rp><rt>おも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>かった。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">他的双眼沉着沉睡</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">ママ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../n3/vocab/\">N3</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t